\newlabel{fig:srmthgratio}{{2.13}{51}{Ratio of HG20+02 to HG00 as the transmission of the SRM is increased for a mode mismatch between the arm cavity and the SRC. The interferometer is in RSE mode. A mode mismatch was introduced by setting the focal length of SR3 to be 12\,mm shorter than the nominal amount.\relax }{figure.caption.67}{}}
